WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.980
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.780
I hope we have a good time together

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.610
Today let's keep

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.240
Sharing laughs

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:26.670
You take care of my true wishes in secret

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:34.220
You always cheer me up after bad days

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:40.560
I'm sure everyone has known it since childhood

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:49.230
You pretend you don't care, but you're always a good friend

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:58.660
You have another busy day as a god; you just can't help but help out others

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:05.000
Everyone is cheered up by your love

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:13.300
I love always being together while you help others

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:20.800
I'll protect that precious smile; you know what I mean

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:24.810
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:28.390
We should go visit the shrine together

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.310
Begin Operation "Mayu Recovery"!

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:37.840
Now, how did this happen, exactly?

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:42.230
They decided to bring Mayu back from Heaven

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:47.100
before the marriage meeting with Tsukuyomi-sama.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.310
Let's go!

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:49.920
Yes.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.060
I don't think this is a good idea.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:52.990
Gonta-san, you too!

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:54.140
Hurry up!

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:55.430
Okay.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.160
Taking a reluctant Gonta with them,

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:03.100
Sasana and Meiko snuck into
the mansion of the head cat god;

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:06.500
that is, into Mayu's family home.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.260
What will happen now?

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.570
Got it.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.260
Guys, we shouldn't do this!

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.830
This way!

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.830
Hey, you listening?

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:30.800
So they came, as expected.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.860
Mayu-sama's room should be about here.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:39.970
Mayu-sama!

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:43.480
Mayu!

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:43.480
Mayu-sama!

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.070
What is it?

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:48.480
Sasana, Meiko...

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.810
Gonta too. Why are you here?

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.620
You look adorable!

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:59.700
Mayu-sama, let's get married right now!

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:02.410
Hey, Sasana, snap out of it!

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.920
Hold it, Sasana! I won't let you
make advances to her!

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:09.750
When we were little, we fought
a lot over who'd be the bride,

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.620
but seeing you like this, I want
you as my bride right now!

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:15.980
This godly discovery shows a new side of you!

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:18.930
I want to take you home immediately!

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:21.900
Guys, did you forget why you came here?

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.810
Calm down and listen to me!

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:27.330
My divine powers have been sealed, so I can't run away!

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.520
Open a door to Earth with your powers—

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.940
Sorry, but you'll have to stop right there!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.220
K-Kuroe!

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.450
I can't let you go!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.770
Kuroe, I beg you! Please overlook her escape!

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:43.160
Yeah, you're Mayu's childhood friend!
You got into mischief together!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.710
I really want to overlook this,

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.460
but there's a reason I can't.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.400
Then we have no choice.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.960
We'll break out by force!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.590
If you try, then I'll also—

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.430
What's this commotion?

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:56.750
Today's a sacred day for a marriage meeting!

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.760
Akarihime-sama!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.350
Madam!

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:01.260
This is the Mistress's command.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.870
I can't oppose her!

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:06.550
I beg you. Let Mayu-sama...

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.900
I can't let Mayu-sama outside.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.400
Madam!

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:15.400
Amaterasu-sama wants Mayu
to be Tsukuyomi-sama's bride.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.570
I cannot refuse this request.

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:19.030
But...

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:24.410
Just as Kuroe can't defy me,
I can't defy Amaterasu-sama, either.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.620
Are you okay with that, Mayu?!

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:28.720
Hey, Mayu, are you listening?!

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:34.420
It won't work. Mayu-sama is spacing out
because her powers are sealed.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.460
Mayu, let's go back together!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.380
But the spell...

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.680
It seems you won't listen.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:44.880
Therefore, I order you,
as the lord of this divine domain:

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.680
Leave this mansion!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:50.730
Kuroe!

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:51.410
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.650
Keep a close watch on Mayu until the meeting.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:55.320
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:07.870
Um, Yoshino-san, you don't have to be so tense.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:12.880
Yes, I do. They asked me to keep watch
here while they were gone.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:23.110
I'll protect you while Mayu-sama is gone, Yuzu-san!

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:27.070
It's an enemy attack!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.270
What's going on?

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.650
I see. So Mayu-chan's not here, huh?

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:35.270
Yeah.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:40.790
That's why I'm guarding Yuzu-san
and the shop in Mayu's place!

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:41.840
Is that so?

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.990
Haruka-san, did you want to see
Mayu-sama about something?

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.780
I wanted her to examine this.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:50.180
Oh, it's a well-preserved Ko-Imari dish.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.410
You wanted to show this to Mayu-sama, not me?

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.720
I'm keeping it for a friend.

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:58.460
The issue isn't whether it's real or fake.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:02.560
Apparently there's an evil spirit
possessing that dish.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:07.340
I kept telling my friend it's
probably just her imagination,

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.390
but she said that she's been hearing
strange sounds at night since she got the dish.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:17.240
Further, she heard someone counting dishes
when no one's around, so I thought I'd look into it.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:20.790
I-I know! That must be Oiwa-san!

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.320
No, Okiku-san's the one that counts dishes.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.200
So show that to Mayu-chan!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.200
Hold on!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.740
Oh my, this is a problem.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:37.250
Right. Yoshino-san, you're a
goddess too, aren't you?

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.840
Can't you figure out something?

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.550
I-I can't! I'm not good with ghosts!

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:43.790
I specialize in things related to cherry blossoms!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:46.420
Take care of the place while I'm gone, Yoshino!

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.050
Take care of the place while we're gone, Yoshino!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.550
I-I'll give it a try!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:57.300
If I open my eyes wide and stare into the dish...

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:03.310
I can't do it!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:06.790
This isn't my specialty.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.770
I see.

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:10.020
Oh, come to think of it...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.480
What's Mayu-sama's specialty?

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:17.860
Loafing around?

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:18.940
Could be.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:26.870
But Mayu-sama is a cat god, so her
specialty is to guard the lunar vault.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:30.890
Yes, and because cat gods
have to protect something,

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:34.230
they have amazing abilities to
see through anything suspicious!

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:39.380
So I'm sure Mayu-sama would've sensed
the evil spirit haunting this dish and...

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.880
I wonder if Mayu-sama will come back?

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:45.760
I'm worried too, but she's
making you even more worried.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.760
I-I'm not really worried!

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:52.490
In fact, with that freeloader gone,
I'm happy to have less work to do!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:55.920
Even if she doesn't come back, I'll...

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:00.480
Where are we?

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:03.480
Looks like we're at the farthest end of Takamagahara.

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:05.790
Right now, Mayu-sama would be...

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.430
Why are you sighing, Sasana?

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:13.940
Are you okay with letting
Tsukuyomi-sama take Mayu?

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:17.370
Of course not...

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:22.500
but we saw how powerless we are
against her mother's spells.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:28.430
Some things in this world can't be accomplished
with just feelings and willpower.

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:32.690
I'm disappointed in you.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:33.340
Forget it!

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:36.670
You can just lie there,

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:40.490
but I'll never consider you my rival ever again.

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.270
You don't understand, Meiko!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.520
You don't know how I feel.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:53.030
The relationship between Mayu-sama and me
originated from a misunderstanding between our fathers.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.850
Because they wrote engagement papers
in front of Amaterasu-sama,

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.040
they couldn't back out later. That's all.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.260
Our relationship springs
from a misunderstanding.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:08.960
The only thing that kept me
going were those papers,

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:13.950
but neither Amaterasu-sama nor
Mayu-sama's mother is on my side anymore!

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:17.660
Wait. I thought I'd just listen,
but what's wrong with you?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.860
Mother, Father, Amaterasu-sama...

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:23.850
What's important is how Mayu and we feel!

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:28.080
If something gets in the way,
we should just blow it away!

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:33.600
I'm not sure how Mayu-sama feels,
and her feelings are most important.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:38.530
Mayu doesn't need me as much as I need her.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:42.330
Even after she was exiled from Takamagahara,

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.940
Mayu-sama quickly found
a new home for herself.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:48.410
I don't know if someone like her needs me!

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:50.620
Of course you don't!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:59.250
Even if you're unsure, are you all right
with Mayu marrying Tsukuyomi-sama?

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.750
Do you think Mayu wants that?

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:06.510
Let's find Mayu and see
how she really feels.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:14.830
So why don't we let
the young ones be alone?

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:18.670
How about taking a walk in the garden?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:19.950
Well, sure.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.070
Oh, that's a great idea!

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:26.230
I hope Mayu doesn't make any mistakes.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.380
I feel nervous too.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.690
But really, I almost didn't
recognize you, Mayu-san.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:40.860
They say makeup makes the woman,
but I was quite surprised.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:46.200
I don't think we've met often enough
for you to say that you didn't recognize me.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.830
Oh, actually, I know all about you.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:54.390
Enough that I'm ready to marry you now.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:56.610
You must be joking.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:11:00.460
Also, this is quite different
from what Amane said.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:05.940
That's because you're going to be
Kukuri-sama's guardian cat in my stead!

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:09.060
You are the only daughter of
the leading cat god family.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.740
There's no problem with your lineage.

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:15.200
You've earned Tsukuyomi-sama's favor. Be glad.

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:19.580
She said I'd be a guardian cat at the
lunar vault and Kukuri-sama's successor.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.600
So what's the scheme behind this farce?

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:27.320
Please don't call it a scheme
as if it were something evil.

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:33.640
What happened was that when I said I wanted you,
my sister misunderstood what I meant.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:38.600
I found the misunderstanding amusing,
so I decided to play along.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:43.060
Why didn't you tell them the truth?
That's what I call a scheme!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:47.310
Do you know the trouble that Sasana, Meiko,
and even Gonta got into because of that?!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:52.090
I see. Then maybe we'll have
a lively time today.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.830
Lots of cats have gathered!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.540
We'll reach the garden of the lunar shrine
when we pass through this place.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.240
That's the atlas we used in grade school.

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:10.320
I take good care of my possessions!

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.850
Man, seeing that
brings back memories.

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.180
Let's hurry!

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:15.480
We're getting deeper inside!

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:18.830
Then let me get straight to the point.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.730
You're aware of the surge in the
Nezumi population on the Moon, correct?

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:27.200
It's the first time this has happened
since the creation of the universe.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:32.990
Yes, so that's why you want me to guard
the lunar vault in Amane's place, right?

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.540
That's right!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:38.770
Um, to be frank,
I'll be much worse at it.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:44.350
Oh, as for that, Amane-san apparently misunderstood
what we meant when she talked to you.

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:48.850
Actually, there's no rule about having
just one guardian cat at the lunar vault.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:49.570
Huh?

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:56.490
I'll be blunt. Mayu-san, I'd like you to
work with Amane-san as a guardian cat.

00:12:56.490 --> 00:13:01.580
That is, you'll be another candidate
to be Kukuri-hime's successor.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:04.120
But why me?

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:07.740
To be honest,
my divine powers are weak.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:12.340
You certainly possess only
ordinary powers at the moment,

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:17.540
but that's because your parents sealed
the powers you inherited from your ancestors.

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:21.720
You're underestimating yourself, Mayu-san.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.500
Of course, you may turn down the offer.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.840
Enthusiasm and devotion
can't be forced, after all.

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:38.070
However, please think about what you can do
that would be best for everyone.

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:41.240
The best I can do?

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.660
Sasana, Gonta, stand back!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.750
If you swing that around here,
the lunar shrine will be...

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:51.000
Mahakala taser!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.260
I wanna go home now!

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:02.620
An enemy attack?!

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:04.450
Oh, Yurara-san!

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:08.000
You were having a nice dream, weren't you?

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:12.010
This room feels spacious...

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.180
just because that kid isn't here anymore.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.300
Yes.

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:18.950
Would you like some fried tofu sushi?

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:19.660
Shizuha-san!

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:24.420
Gonta kept asking me
to take care of you.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.410
I'm here, so it's all right!

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.170
Grandpa!

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:33.430
How are you doing, Yoshino?
Watching the house properly?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.070
Yeah, I'm managing it!

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:38.430
I'm doing my job right!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.430
Good evening!

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:44.270
I see. Mayu-chan still isn't back?

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.680
Mayu-chan gave me a call and said
we should play some games together.

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.180
I see.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:51.690
Should I play with you instead?

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:52.970
Really?

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:56.030
All right, Shoudou, how about
we have a match as well?

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:56.820
Oh, sounds good!

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.570
Grandpa, no betting on anything!

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:02.450
We can play games, but we can't bet?
What the hell?

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:04.900
Mayu-sama?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.910
It's me.

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.410
Shamo-chan!

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:15.290
I'm here to return the manga
I borrowed from Mayu.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:16.070
Right.

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:17.090
I see everyone's here!

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:17.720
Yeah!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:18.920
Grandpa, betting is...

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.430
...so much fun!

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:22.480
Yurara, you want in too?
You can bet your baku.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.330
No way.

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:29.140
Oh, right! Would you all
like to have dinner here?

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.550
Oh, can I?

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:33.660
I couldn't wish for more!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:34.540
I want nabe.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.510
Agreed!

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.020
What kind of nabe?

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:38.450
I'll help!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:38.900
Sure!

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:43.650
Guys!

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:48.770
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:49.530
This is bad!

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.280
What are you guys—

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:51.910
Swordfish!

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:57.060
I had no choice!
He suddenly started shouting!

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:57.660
Let's go!

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.420
It's over!

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.340
Amane!

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.340
You... Why?

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:15.120
D-Don't get the wrong idea.
I wasn't trying to save you.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:20.770
I don't know why, but somehow I felt...
I happened to come here.

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:24.360
And when I came to my senses,
I had thrown this. That's all.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:26.610
That's all? Do you think
that's all right?

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.830
I-I don't know.

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.110
It's just that...

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:34.370
I was just wondering how
Mayu really feels about this.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:37.620
Then I found myself here.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:40.180
Go!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.120
Amane!

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.880
Hurry!

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:45.380
Thank you!

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.810
They're so rash.

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:52.970
Mayu-san, you're quite popular.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:54.890
There are so many rivals here.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:56.890
Mayu!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:16:59.980
Mayu-sama!

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:01.420
Mayu!

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:03.890
To be honest, I'm impressed
you made it this far.

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:06.020
I admire your determination.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.660
I'm determined now!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:08.400
Too late!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:12.870
Tsukuyomi-sama, I beg you!
Please give Mayu-sama back!

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:17.160
Yes, we won't submit to
such tyranny, even from you!

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:20.160
So please!

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:24.920
What if I say no?

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.670
I'm prepared for the worst.

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.670
We'll take her by force, of course!

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:31.530
In any case, we're taking
Mayu back, no matter what!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.930
For Yuzu-san's sake!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.870
Now, what should I do?

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:39.500
U-Um, Tsukuyomi-sama,
please handle this peacefully.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:43.440
I hate to ignore your
special pleading, Mayu-san,

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:47.690
but they're obstacles in my way.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.690
And unfortunately, I...

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:52.950
show no mercy to enemies!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:57.950
You are facing the Lord of the Night.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.460
No, the divine power is...

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:06.460
You!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:08.710
Mayu-sama!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.220
Bow your heads, every one of you!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:15.220
Ouch!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.430
The divine power of his words?

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:28.390
N-No way! My body won't move!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:29.930
Wh-What's going on?

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:39.280
Tsukuyomi-sama, I beg you! Please...

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:40.780
Please...

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.180
Oh?

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.820
She can speak even though
she's under my spell.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:46.780
Interesting.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:57.330
The emergency drill is now over!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:58.530
What?

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.530
D-Drill?

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.530
Right, Mayu-san?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.950
What? R-Right!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:09.540
And now you're dismissed.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.970
Drill? It was all pretend?

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.550
No way!

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:23.100
Mayu-san, I'm looking
forward to your response.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.150
Th-This is bad!

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:29.940
Now I'm hugely indebted to him for the favor!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.600
Have another cup.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:30.850
I'm honored.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.980
I hope those two get along well.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:36.870
It's been quite noisy outside.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.310
Will you be all right by yourself?

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:41.390
I'm really leaving, okay?

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.360
Okay.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.950
Make sure you lock the doors!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.600
Take care, Yuzu-chan!

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:48.540
Okay!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:51.270
I'm free during the winter,
so I'll be back tomorrow!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:52.130
Me too.

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:53.130
Me too!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.160
Sure, please come!

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:21.410
Ouch.

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:22.850
M-Mayu-sama!

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.920
Oh, Yuzu!

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:28.190
Jeez, I messed up my landing.

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:31.870
And sorry to ask you
so suddenly, but I'm hungry.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:34.420
Maybe some eggs and rice... Huh?

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:37.310
What eggs and rice?

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:39.430
I was so worried!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:43.540
I was worried you might
never come back!

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:45.410
I've had enough!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.440
Y-Yuzu!

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.940
Say, Yuzu...

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:56.120
What is it? Do you need
something other than dinner?

00:20:56.120 --> 00:21:00.810
Well, it's not critical,
but I forgot to tell you this earlier.

00:21:00.810 --> 00:21:04.080
If it's not important,
please keep quiet for now.

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.320
What's that dish?

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:12.370
Why is it here?

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:15.590
Oh, I'm holding onto it for Haruka-san.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:22.280
Isn't there something
unusual about that dish?

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:25.800
Something unusual?
You're the Ko-Imari expert.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:29.970
I didn't mean whether
it's an antique, but rather...

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.440
whether it's cursed or haunted.

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.170
Cursed?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:37.860
There's nothing in it.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:39.970
It's a normal dish.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:47.020
By the way, what did you
forget to tell me earlier?

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:48.390
O-Oh, that?

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:51.630
Well, it's really not important.

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:54.380
I'm back.

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:59.520
Welcome back.

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:03.460
How was the marriage meeting?

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:06.140
It was canceled.

00:22:06.140 --> 00:22:10.650
Amaterasu-sama misunderstood
the situation. No way.

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:14.900
But they offered Mayu the chance to
become a guardian cat, thankfully.

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:18.890
Will Mayu-sama accept
the offer meekly, though?

00:22:18.890 --> 00:22:20.890
Mayu isn't all that meek, in fact.

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:23.840
Still, she's a nice, obedient girl at heart.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:30.420
Mayu, Mayu, Mayu...

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:28.430
Then what about the offer to be a guardian cat for the lunar vault?

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:30.130
Oh, that?

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:36.170
So Mayu-sama didn't give you
an immediate response?

00:22:36.170 --> 00:22:37.330
No.

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:41.550
Amane-san, you'll have to work hard
by yourself for a little longer.

00:22:41.550 --> 00:22:42.940
Of course!

00:22:44.740 --> 00:22:46.060
That's...

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:47.570
shelved for now.

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:48.120
Huh?

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.060
Yuzu-san, is Mayu back?

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:52.190
She is!

00:22:59.050 --> 00:23:00.740
Mayu-sama?

00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:05.720
Can I stay here a little longer?

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:11.960
Shamo, help me!

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:13.210
We're in big trouble!

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:14.800
Again?

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:16.500
I bet your shikigami are on strike again.

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:17.850
No, they caught the flu!

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:18.240
What?

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:20.750
Oh, no! When's the deadline?

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:21.650
In three days.

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:22.730
Just give up, then.

00:23:22.730 --> 00:23:24.570
What? What are you talking about?

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:25.430
What deadline?

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:26.890
She'll make you work if you get involved!

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:28.820
You <i>look like you have talent.</i>

00:23:28.820 --> 00:23:30.430
Sensei, we don't have time!

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:33.080
Gosh, this place is so rowdy.

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:37.230
Mayu-sama, do you have any photos
from the marriage meeting?

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:38.070
Nope!
